-        ii. Let $V_2$ be the value in Channel 2 ($R(x)\tilde{D}(x)$).
-        iii. Compute $R(x) = V_2 / V_1$ (handling division by zero if $V_1 \approx 0$) [S1].
-        iv. Compute $D(x) = V_1 + R(x)$ [S1].
